                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>25</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Æ        </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>WHEN</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>&gt;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>2.00%</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>THEN</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>50</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Æ        </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>WHEN</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>&gt;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>1.00%</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>THEN</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>75</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Æ        </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>ELSE</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>100</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='14'>5. Views</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- One Period View</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: This view presents OOS performance data for a single selected period, allowing users to analyze vendor performance across different chains and countries for that specific timeframe. It features bar charts and tables showing: </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>   - General Score by Entity/Country, Chain, and Vendor</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Displays scores for each dimension, color-coded to indicate strong or weak performance. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>   - By Metric Table</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Provides detailed performance metrics for each time period, including % Items Not Delivered, % Items Not Processed, etc. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>- Multi-Period View</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: This view allows users to see trends over multiple periods (daily, weekly, etc.). Users can select the granularity of the data (e.g., daily, monthly) and compare performance across entities, chains, and vendors over time. This view includes: </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>   - General Score by Date Granularity</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Displays trends for each selected time period. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>   - General Score by Chain, Vendor, and Entity/Country</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Shows how performance metrics evolve over multiple periods. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>   - By Metric Table</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Tracks each key metric across different periods to observe improvements or declines. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Both views offer the ability to export data to Excel for further analysis and support user-defined filters for custom reporting. The interactive graphs and tables make it easy to focus on problematic areas or top performers. </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
